            </note>
            <note corresp="#d271-f2" n="2" xml:id="d271-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 126765 to Bonn, April 1, proposed U.S.-FRG consultations regarding
                    asylum seekers. (Department of State, Central Foreign Policy File,
                    N840006–0412)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
